#: kcmaccess.cpp:183
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Tawışlı Zil"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:190
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "&Sistem zilen qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:192
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Üzençä zil &qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:194
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. Normally, "
"this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanma bilgelängän bulsa, bar bulğan sistem qıñğırawı qullanılır. Sistem "
"qıñğırawın köyläw ısulların beler öçen \"Sistem Qıñğırawı\" idärä bülegenä "
"qara. Ğädättä ul ğädi \"biip\" tawışı ğına."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound file. "
"If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell."
"<p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""
"Tawış faylın uynawçı qıñğıraw qullanırğa teläsäñ, monı sayla. Monı eşlämäkçe "
"isäñ, bälki sistem qıñğırawın sünderergä teliseñder."
"<p> Zínhar, iseñdä tot, äkren sanaqlarda qıñğıraw çaqırğan waqíğasınnan ber "
"arağa soñ qala ala."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:204
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Uynatası &tawış:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:209
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound file "
"here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"\"Üzençä zil qullanası\" digän köylämä yanıq torsa, bonda tawış biremen saylap "
"bula. \"Saylaw..\" digän töymägä çirtep, tawış biremen saylaw täräzäse "
"açılaçaq."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:226
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Kürenüçän Zil"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:232
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Küreneşle zil &qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:234
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torğanda \"kürenmäle zil\" açıla, yäğni naşar işetkän keşelär "
"öçen tawışlı belderügä östämä belderü bulaçaq."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:240
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Küräkne &kire it"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:243
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""
"Asqaraq bilgelängän waqıt eçendä bar töslär kiregä äyländerelgän bulaçaq."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:245
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Küräkne &cemeldä"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:247
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "Bonda äytelgän ara eçendä küräk bu üzençä tös belän töslängän bulaçaq."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:253
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr "Küräkne cemeldüçe kürenmäle zil öçen qullanılğan tös saylaw."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Eş arası:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:261 kcmaccess.cpp:314 kcmaccess.cpp:332
msgid " msec"
msgstr " msek"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:263
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being shown."
msgstr "\"Kürengän zil\" digän närsäneñ eşläw ozınlığın bonda köyläp bula."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:280
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Zil"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:288
msgid "S&ticky Keys"
msgstr "&Yabışmalı Töymä"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:294
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "&Yabışqan töymä qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:299
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr "Yabışma töymälär &bikläw"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:302
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "Töymä Ä&krenäytü"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:308
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "Äkren töymä &qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:316
msgid "Dela&y:"
msgstr "&Ara:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:320
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "Sirekü Töymäse"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:326
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "Sikerüçe töymä &qullanası"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:334
msgid "D&elay:"
msgstr "&Ara:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:337
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "Eşçän İtü Ğämäle"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:343
msgid "Use gestures for activating the above features"
msgstr "Östäge eşçänleklär küse qılanışları aşa yandırıla"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:347
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Kiläse eşli aluların açtıra torğan töylek qılanışlar qullanuın açıp bula: \n"
"Yabışqan töymä: Shift töymäsen berber artlı 5 tapqır basu\n"
"Äkren töymä: Shift töymäsen 8 sekund basıq totu"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:351
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Kiläse eşli aluların açtıra torğan töylek qılanışlar qullanuın açıp bula: \n"
"Küse Töymäläre: %1\n"
"Yabışqan töymä: Shift töymäsen berber artlı 5 tapqır basu\n"
"Äkren töymä: Shift töymäsen 8 sekund basıq totu"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:358
msgid "Show a confirmation dialog whenever a gesture is used"
msgstr "Qılanış qullanğanda kileşü sarağan täräzä kürsätü"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:360
msgid ""
"KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a gesture is used if this option "
"is checked.\n"
"Be carefull do know what yo do if you uncheck it as then the AccessX settings "
"will always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torsa, qılanış qılğanda KDE kileşü täräzäsen kürsätäçäk.\n"
"Anı sünderep quyğanda saq bulası, çönki ul çaqta AccessX caylawları kileşü "
"çığarmíça aşıralaçaq."

